# Play test of Redstack Maze (CIPlay redstack_maze, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The maze's cells of 6 m (x 10..46, z -42..-6; cell centres x 13 19 25 31 37 43, z -39 -33 -27 -21 -15 -9): the mouth on
# the south at 19 -42; the route - north to 19 -33, west to 13 -33, north to 13 -21, east to 37 -21, north to 37 -15, the
# gate at 37 -12, the pool at 37 -9; the shrine deck's ladders at 40.1 -9, the deck 8.5 m; the hut x 0..4.5, z -46..-41.5
# (deck 1.6 m), the pier along z -44.5..-43 to x 16.5.
# Quest (10 steps): the hut, the chart, the hut's box, the mouth, the dead end's barrel, the two puffers, the shrine,
# the pearl, the strongbox, Tamsin's two hens.
island Redstack Maze
offset -0.3026 0.6476
expect step 0
expect title Before the Tide Turns
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 2
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
at 2.25 -43.75 h=2.6
zone tidehouse
expect step 1
read The tide-keeper's chart
expect step 2
open Tide-keeper's box
expect step 3
open Tide-keeper's strongbox
expect message pearl-shaped hollow
use shrinebell
expect message pearl pays
walk 2.25 -43.75 to 15.5 -43.75 h=1.6
zone mazemouth
expect step 4
open Barrel in the dead end
expect step 5
kill Puffer fish
expect step 6
use tidelever
expect message seventy-five seconds
use tidelever
expect message still open
walk 15.5 -43.75 to 19 -43.75 to 19 -33 h=-1.2
walk 19 -33 to 13 -33 to 13 -21 h=-1.2
walk 13 -21 to 37 -21 to 37 -15 h=-1.2
walk 37 -15 to 37 -8.5 h=-1.2
zone shrine
expect step 7
at 41.6 -9 h=9.5
walk 41.6 -9 to 43.6 -9 h=8.5
use heronnest
expect story heronpearl 1
expect step 8
use heronnest
expect message nest is empty
use shrinebell
wait 3
expect message tide-keeper's landing
open Tide-keeper's strongbox
expect step 9
catch Chicken 2
expect done
